    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellbound Stumble is a 2v2 arena magic shooter with ragdolls and highly-saturated graphics. When joining a game, you will be added to a queue that starts the match after 4 players have joined. There are two spells that can be used to attack. The fireball has low damage, but high attack speed, reload speed, and a big hitbox. The icicle has high damage, but lacks in the other factors.</p>",
